OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,FThe 40th anniversary of the COW
OL,9,F(Computer-Originated World) globe saw
OL,10,Fit make an unexpected comeback.
OL,11,
OL,12,FA flashback sequence in EastEnders `
OL,13,Fwhich debuted the day after the iconic
OL,14,FBBC1 ident ` provided the perfect
OL,15,Fexcuse to dust it off.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIn modern terms, the introduction of
OL,18,Fthe COW was a rebrand of BBC One. It
OL,19,Fcame alongside major schedule changes
OL,20,Fdesigned to boost flagging ratings.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever it is worth remembering it was
OL,7,Fnot commissioned for this purpose. It
OL,8,Fwas the logical conclusion of a drive
OL,9,Fby Presentation over several yearsB  to
OL,10,Freplace models with computer graphics.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIt was a major infrastructure project.
OL,13,
OL,14,FSolid state devices were built for the
OL,15,Fnations and regions. The fact their
OL,16,Fident looked as good as network's for
OL,17,Fthe first time was a revelation.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12803
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe know the devices were all installed
OL,7,Fbefore Christmas 1984 ready for a
OL,8,FJanuary start but the COW's
OL,9,Fintroduction was delayed until the new
OL,10,Flook schedule began in February.
OL,11,
OL,12,FSo given all this effort it is
OL,13,Fsurprising that a few inconsistencies
OL,14,Facross the network crept in.
OL,15,
OL,16,FMost obviously, there was the issue of
OL,17,Fhow to promote Ceefax subtitles.
OL,18,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12804
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe network COW had an elegant caption
OL,7,Fwhich could be switched on and off as
OL,8,Frequired. It fitted the image
OL,9,Fbeautifully.
OL,10,
OL,11,FBut the nations were left to find their
OL,12,Fown solutions.
OL,13,
OL,14,FTheir Astons promoting subtitles were
OL,15,Finconsistent and sometimes looked
OL,16,Fclunky against the elegant ident.
OL,17,
OL,18,FCould a design solution not have been
OL,19,Ffound to provide a bespoke solution for
OL,20,Fthe nations?
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12805
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile relatively few programmes were
OL,7,Fsubtitled in 1985, the proportion
OL,8,Fquickly grew.
OL,9,
OL,10,FThen there is the question of the clock
OL,11,Fdesign?
OL,12,
OL,13,FWhy did Cardiff and Glasgow have a
OL,14,Fclock with a blue centre dot, matching
OL,15,Fthe design of the previous network
OL,16,Fclock and the BBC Two clock?
OL,17,
OL,18,FNetwork's clock had the dot missing.
OL,19,FThis was also the case in Northern
OL,20,FIreland.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12806
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt may not be coincidental that
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's clock equipment was
OL,8,Fin use from the previous autumn and got
OL,9,Fupdated once the new look was
OL,10,Fintroduced.
OL,11,
OL,12,FWere Cardiff and Glasgow using an early
OL,13,Fdesign? And if so why was it not
OL,14,Fupdated?
OL,15,
OL,16,FOr was the "error" with network and
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland?
OL,18,
OL,19,FLook closely at the BBC One Wales COW
OL,20,Ftoo.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12807
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shading of the '1' is slightly
OL,7,Fdifferent to other versions?
OL,8,
OL,9,FWas this deliberate design? Or an
OL,10,Ferror?
OL,11,
OL,12,FGiven that the channel in Wales was
OL,13,Fstill known as BBC Wales ` not BBC One
OL,14,FWales ` was consideration given to
OL,15,Famending the design?B The name did not
OL,16,Fchange orally until around 1988.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12808
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F128A1768699310
