OL,3,GFEATURES CReflections on BBC One's COW
OL,4,Cera on its 40th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland had been using the name BBC
OL,7,FScotland since October 1983 but changed
OL,8,Fthe name back to BBC One Scotland when
OL,9,Fthe COW debuted.
OL,10,
OL,11,FFinally the way in which the nations
OL,12,Fmodified programme slides was
OL,13,Finconsistent. Did each nation just find
OL,14,Fits own way to amend the basic design?
OL,15,
OL,16,FIt's all fascinating.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,129,120,200,300,0,100
